Original Work
------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenTransition is a fork and continuation of TransTracks, a photo-journal
app for tracking gender transition journeys.

  Original Work  : TransTracks for Android
  Original Author: Cassie Wilson <contact@transtracks.app>
  Copyright      : (C) 2018-2021 TransTracks (Cassie Wilson)
  License        : GNU General Public License, version 3 or later
  Source         : https://github.com/TransTracks/TransTracks-Android
                   (archived; the original Play Store listing was retired
                   in 2025)

TransTracks was the work of a single developer, Cassie Wilson, who built
and released it under GPL-3.0-or-later and supported it for years before
retiring the app in 2025.

Modifications, additions, rebranding, and the Wear OS companion app are
copyright (C) 2025-2026 Shelbeely and OpenTransition contributors, and
are likewise licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later, preserving the original
license chain.

We are deeply grateful to Cassie Wilson, without whose work
OpenTransition would not exist.

